WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.464
Describe where Ghana and its three land neighbours are located.

00:00:04.283 --> 00:00:09.585
Ghana is in West Africa. Côte d’Ivoire is to the west, Togo to the east and Burkina

00:00:09.585 --> 00:00:10.833
Faso to the north.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:17.060
To the south is the Atlantic Ocean. These directions help us read a simple regional

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.276
map and understand how Ghana connects with nearby countries.

00:00:21.117 --> 00:00:25.554
Use a printed map or globe to identify all four directions around Ghana.
